      "text": "The petition coming on for hearing, upon perusing the Petition and the affidavit filed in support thereof and upon hearing the arguments of Sri SRINIVASA RAO NARRA Advocate for the Petitioner, GP FOR REVENUE for the Respondent Nos.1 ,4 to 7; The Deputy Solicitor General of India for the Respondent No.2: Sri S.S. Varma, Standing Counsel for the Respondent No.3 and the Court made the following.\nDuggineni Narasimha Rao vs And on 2 December, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/188206915/\n3 ORDER In no case, Sri S.S. Varma, Standing Counsel for NHAI, represented before this Court and on behalf of the standing counsel, other counsels are representing and obtaining adjournment on one pretext or the other.\nFinally list the matter after ten (10) days for filing of counter affidavit, failing which the respondent Nos.2 and 3 shall appear before this Court.",
